{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/14","id":4477049303,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUAdvbc8AAAABCtpZ1w","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/14","diff_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/14.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pull/14.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/14","number":14,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix protection collector v2 identity and incomplete evidence handling","user":{"login":"danny0971haha","id":202909309,"node_id":"U_kgDODBgmfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/202909309?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha","html_url":"https://github.com/danny0971haha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danny0971haha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Protection collector v2 could report complete/absent protection from missing data, pair a moved PR head with the expected commit tree, and infer caller administration from endpoint-required permission headers. This corrective candidate resolves actual refs before reading their trees, validates source shapes and pagination, separates repository authorization from endpoint requirements, and preserves observed rules alongside coverage gaps.\n\nThe change is limited to `tools/review/protection-collector-v2/` and new independent evidence. It starts at the requested TOOL_HEAD; original local drift is reconciled without resetting or rewriting tooling/main/PR11/PR12/PR13.\n\n- Base branch: `main`, observed SHA `22665d7fa9274dfc05de043c8e9663e24e75087e`\n- Corrective base: `b2ea605d5ed507b634f9a2ee5907db39bf129d13`\n- Published head: `12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9`\n- Published tree: `1b176e67b4a398450f26bbf1544ebb7757846dcb`\n- Final tool checkpoint: `cc7614195661ffb18da44d9c5ba6e31c100281b2`; the following publication only adds the handoff/checksums and archives a verbatim diagnostic.\n\nValidation: 60 offline unittests passed. The actual GraphQL query is checked against a saved official live schema, including rejection of the old RateLimit.reset field. Scoped format checks, git diff checks and secret scans passed. Runtime, dependencies, lockfiles, governance workflows, trusted baselines and repository settings are unchanged.\n\nExactly one new read-only acquisition collected 67 responses at `9b13a7fd3c0d7b354d6a5bf8ceefab4c838d112b`. The initial command exited 1 during final evidence scanning because public synthetic test source contained a bare token prefix. The failed attempt is retained. After adding a redaction regression, an offline repack at `43e9a371492bf807db23b3046824807c52beeefe` verified all saved response hashes, applied two documented masks and verified 145 packet hashes. It issued zero new network requests and left derived analysis unchanged. Acquisition and packaging identities are separate in the packet.\n\nObserved applicable sources include active ruleset 21580900 and classic pattern main, with expected context bound to app/integration 15368. Expected main/PR11/frozen identities matched before/after. Official product scope plus observed personal non-fork ownership supports org/enterprise NOT_APPLICABLE for this snapshot. This does not authorize PR11 adoption or establish future protection state.\n\n[18-section handoff](https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/blob/12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9/docs/evidence/protection-v2-corrective-20260909/EVIDENCE.md) · [Defects and counterexamples](https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/blob/12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9/docs/evidence/protection-v2-corrective-20260909/CORRECTIONS.md) · [API contract](https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/blob/12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9/docs/evidence/protection-v2-corrective-20260909/API-CONTRACT.md) · [Native packet archive](https://github.com/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/blob/12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9/docs/evidence/protection-v2-corrective-20260909/collection-repacked.tar.gz)\n\nIndependent review is required. No merge, rebase, force-push, settings/ruleset change, deployment, credential access for trading, or exchange write was performed. Historical INPUT_MISSING and run 33967073453 remain unchanged; PR13 retention and trusted-gate adoption issues were not reworked.\n","created_at":"2026-09-08T17:50:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T17:50:39Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c1257b81267df747907e8cb05f9ff25f3c394f79","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/14/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/14/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/issues/14/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danny0971haha/multi-venue-grid-engine/statuses/12d04d82d0a2b02240619633b3264c77eb1754c9","head":{"label":"danny0971haha